          "explanation": "Doctor explains that the IGF-1 and IGFBP-3 results are preliminary and must be confirmed by the formal report, and that the nasal endoscopy entry does not prove tumor status.",
          "quote": "鼻内镜那个页面我又点进去看了，不像抽血结果。上面写“鼻内镜检查”，下面有“局麻”“图文报告”几个字"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly explained the meaning of the IGF-related tests and the nasal endoscopy entry, and did not fabricate or overinterpret the results or the endoscopy entry.",
