      "citations": [],
      "explanation": "The known glucose-tolerance abnormality from the discharge diagnosis and its associated diet/monitoring advice were never mentioned by the doctor in any patient-visible utterance. The record contains explicit instructions for glucose monitoring, but the doctor did not advise the patient to follow discharge diet guidance, monitor for glucose-related symptoms, or link severe glucose symptoms to urgent care. This omission is minor and constitutes an incomplete incorporation of the glucose context.",
